  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4ea107d3d0fbef947af73792cc9f28a0, type: 3}
  m_Name: WednesdayIntro
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueSO
  dialogueType: 0
  sentences:
  - Hello! Kyle recommended this place to me.
  - Here's my Hubert. He looks so cool, doesn't he?
  - His hair is so manly, I designed it myself and all the ladies love it.
  - Also there's something I have to mention. Hubert's always hungry. If he says
    he's not hungry, he's lying because he'll keep eating anyways.
  - I'll be back Friday morning. Make sure he's comfortable while I'm gone.
